.TH ABORT 3
.SH NAME
abort \- generate IOT fault
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B abort
executes the int 0Xf3 (8086) or IOT (PDP-11) instruction.
This
causes a signal that normally terminates the process with a core dump,
which may be used for debugging.
.SH "SEE ALSO"
adb(1), signal(2), exit(2)
.SH DIAGNOSTICS
Usually `IOT trap \- core dumped' from the shell.
.sp
